tana: I can write the quickstart blurb: "When running in Next.js Edge middleware: either provide a bodyFactory, disable retries, or use SDK's buffer helper. Avoid reusing Request.body across attempts." Add troubleshooting note for "Cannot construct Request" and "body used" errors.

